    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT IS SURVIVAL ZOMBIES</h2><br>Survival Zombies is a bloody chaotic survival first person shooter that pits heavily armed players against humanity's greatest fear - hordes of undead<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440730/extras/b30371416f73f486b23b392675c85d74.avif?t=1747501356\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SETTING</h2><br>Survival Zombies is something you have never seen before<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440730/extras/05edf5b8ca7da1b9eadf0ec486815c52.avif?t=1747501356\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br>1K+ Achievements<br><br>Day and night options, rain, night vision, different enemy types, bosses, grenades and loads of guns to put them down.<br><br>Use your wits, speed and anything you can get your hands on in epic zombie brawl!.",
